// XM21
FARM14 FARM14
$limit FARM14 80
$rolloff  FARM14 3000 6000

Sniper/Draw X21DRAW
Sniper/BoltBack X21BACK
Sniper/BoltForward X21FORW
Sniper/CloakFull "Sounds/Weapons/Slot-4/XM21/cloak_full.ogg"
Sniper/CloakEmpty "Sounds/Weapons/Slot-4/XM21/cloak_empty.ogg"
